-It is out -- "D-DAY."

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:10.467
-"D-DAY."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:12.567
-The documentary is out.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:15.767
