just kicked off last week.

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:17.501
How does it all --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:18.667
How does it all feel?

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.701
Yeah.
They love you.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:40.767
I love you.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:43.901
Before you were known as Suga,

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:46.100
