delivery guy?

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:54.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:56.167
You were very good?

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:57.634
Why?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:59.968
