You just...

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:05.434
[ Laughter ]
That helps.

00:01:05.434 --> 00:01:08.267
Yeah, but now
you're who you are.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.100
Congratulations.
I mean, you're -- you're --

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:15.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.334
I'm a Knick fan.

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:18.667
And I saw you yesterday
at the playoffs.

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.100
-Yeah.
-Yeah, there you are.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.234
This is...

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:26.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.501
Looking good.
Exciting news.

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:31.334
You were named
an NBA ambassador.

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:34.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:35.434
What -- What does that mean?

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:37.701
