00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:04.234
Wait!
I got some sound!

00:05:04.234 --> 00:05:05.801
-Yeah.

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:07.968
-I got --
-You did.

00:05:07.968 --> 00:05:10.968
-You kicked off your
giant world tour last week.

00:05:10.968 --> 00:05:13.033
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yeah.

00:05:13.033 --> 00:05:14.801
-Look at this right here.
This is you.

00:05:14.801 --> 00:05:18.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.667
How did it feel
to be back on stage?

00:05:29.167 --> 00:05:31.200
