00:05:47.467 --> 00:05:49.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:56.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.400
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, that's true.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.634
Yeah, you're right. Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

