"Suga: Road to D-DAY."

00:06:06.968 --> 00:06:08.968
Take a look.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:28.934 --> 00:06:31.400
-Suga is a musical genius.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.234
When I've listened
