I figured, hey...

00:07:38.901 --> 00:07:41.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:41.033 --> 00:07:42.801
-Oh!
-It's not vinegar. That's real.

00:07:42.801 --> 00:07:44.033
-It's real.
-It's real.

00:07:44.033 --> 00:07:46.634
-It's real.
-It's real. Congratulations.

00:07:46.634 --> 00:07:47.667
-Yeah.
-Good luck.

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:48.767
Thank you for being here.
-Yeah.

00:07:48.767 --> 00:07:50.767
Suga, everybody!
Agust D!

00:07:50.767 --> 00:07:53.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

